<?xml version="1.0"?>
<!--
  The action buttons lie in the free corner of the table, right of the bottom discards and above the viewer's melds (see
  Table/TableLayout.cpp); two lines of four, laid out against the whole view (ignoreSafeArea) like the table. They start hidden: the
  component shows the ones the person to act can press. The row is x 720..1160, y 440..560: it ends above the row of melds and bonus
  tiles that the phone profile of the layout puts over the large hand (y 564), and it starts right of the bottom discard block of that
  profile (x 712). A button is 104 wide because four fit between the block and the safe area of the narrowest window with side insets
  (x 1165 at the 1:1 window); the fullest claim window shows seven, the fullest turn six, the toggle Declare as wide as the rest. A button says what it does in a plain word (Table/ActionButtons.h, ButtonSpec::wordKey:
  the keys button.<Kind> of config/UIStrings.xml) and, where it concerns tiles, shows them as pictures: a UIImage child NameTile0..2 on the bottom line (the three tiles of
  a chow, the claimed discard of a pung, kong or mahjong, the tile of a concealed kong or of the upgrade), hidden until the component sets
  its sprite (Tile_<notation> of TextureLibrary.xml) and shows it; a picture takes no input, so a click on it is a click on the button.
  A button is 56 view units high (kActionButtonHeight, Table/TouchRegime.h), which is a 32 px touch target from a window of 732 x 412 px;
  the table is a fixed design that the engine scales to the window, so a smaller window has smaller buttons and tiles (a tile is 21 x 28
  units, the 3:4 of an atlas cell). Below that window the component hides this canvas and shows ActionsCompact instead
  (NeedsCompactActions), which holds the same buttons by name on the bar under the table, but only where that bar holds the row at its
  height at that canvas width. In a window that the table fills to the bottom (16:9 below 731 x 411, a short wide one like 1000 x 400, a
  landscape phone) or whose bar is lower than the row (a narrow window like 480 x 360 or 600 x 570) this canvas stays, slightly under 32 px but
  clear of the viewer's hand.
  The label Hint above the row shows the sentence of the button under the pointer ({actionHint}, set by the component in the
  current language from UIElement::hovered and again when the language changes; hidden while there is none). It takes no input, so
  it never eats a click; it lies in the gutter between the wall and the right seat's discards (x 832..1000, y 256..436: 168 wide,
  room for the longer words of a translation; clear of their plates and of the row it explains, MahjongTableScreenTest holds the
  place; the discards of a side seat are turned, which made their columns wider and the gutter narrower). A touch screen has no hover.
  In a portrait view (720 x 1280, the variant below) the buttons are 68 high (kPortraitActionButtonHeight, Table/TouchRegime.h: the view is
  720 wide, so a 68 unit button is 34 pt on a phone of 360 pt and a touch target without ActionsCompact) and 92 wide (the toggle Declare 124: its word and box need it), so that the fullest
  claim window, seven buttons, is one row of 692 units (x 12..704, y 924..992; the fullest turn is 628) in the band of free ground between the viewer's discards and
  the viewer's seat plate, under the waiting row of Hints (y 836..916) and clear of the plate (y 1028) and of the row SelectedTile (y 1036) of
  Hud. The Hint label lies in the free ground right of the viewer's discards, under MoveLine (x 480..712, y 716..828). Where the buttons are under
  32 px (a portrait window narrower than 339 px) ActionsCompact takes over on the bar under the table; the one window of the matrix that
  keeps this canvas small is 1:1 at 480 px (25.5 px: the table fills it to the sides and the bottom, so there is no bar).
  In a wide view (1560 x 720, the variant with minAspect:2: the landscape table lies 140 units in from each side) the row and the
  Hint label move right by the wing (x 860 and 972) and keep every place they have in landscape; the buttons are as they were.
  In a narrow view (1080 x 768, the variant with orientation:landscape;maxAspect:1.55; Table/TableLayout.cpp, the narrow table) the free
  ground is right of the bottom discard block (x 468..612) and above the viewer's row of melds (y 636): the row is x 620..996, y 500..620
  (8 clear of the block, of the right seat's meld column at x 1004 and 16 of the melds), and the buttons are 88 wide, so four make a line
  of 376 and the fullest claim window, seven, two lines (the Declare toggle too). The fullest turn, six, is two lines as well, with
  UpgradeKong 104 wide because "Add to pung" does not fit 88; the word of Win is the small size, "Маджонг!" at 22 does not fit 88 in a window of
  720 x 480. The Hint label has no room beside that row (the gutter between the wall and the right seat's discards is 73 wide), so it lies left of
  the bottom discard block, under the wall ring and over SelectedTile of Hud: x 280..460, y 444..568, 8 clear of the wall ring (y 436), of the
  left seat's discards (x 109..269, y 312..456) and of the block (x 468).
  The narrow table is 768 high, so a button is 33 px or more in every window from 640 x 480 up and ActionsCompact takes over only in a nearly
  square window (610 x 600: a bar of 83 px under the table holds its row).
-->
<node name="Actions" layer="10">
  <components>
    <component type="UICanvasComponent" space="SceneView" useSafeArea="true">
      <elements>
        <element type="UILabel" name="Hint" anchor="TopLeft" ignoreSafeArea="true" visible="false" x="832" y="256" width="168" height="180" text="{actionHint}" fontSize="18" align="Center" verticalAlign="Center" color="0,0,0,200" />
        <element type="UIStack" name="ActionRow" anchor="TopLeft" ignoreSafeArea="true" x="720" y="440" width="440" height="120" direction="Horizontal" spacing="8" wrapChildren="true">
          <children>
          <element type="UIButton" name="Win" visible="false" width="104" height="56" text="{#button.Win}" fontSize="22" action="MahjongWin" color="40,110,60,255" />
          <element type="UIButton" name="Mahjong" visible="false" width="104" height="56" text="{#button.ClaimMahjong}" fontSize="18" verticalAlign="Top" action="MahjongClaimMahjong" color="40,110,60,255">
            <children>
              <element type="UIImage" name="MahjongTile0" visible="false" anchor="Bottom" y="-3" width="21" height="28" />
            </children>
          </element>
          <element type="UIButton" name="Pung" visible="false" width="104" height="56" text="{#button.ClaimPung}" fontSize="18" verticalAlign="Top" action="MahjongClaimPung" color="45,75,120,255">
            <children>
              <element type="UIImage" name="PungTile0" visible="false" anchor="Bottom" y="-3" width="21" height="28" />
            </children>
          </element>
          <element type="UIButton" name="Kong" visible="false" width="104" height="56" text="{#button.ClaimKong}" fontSize="18" verticalAlign="Top" action="MahjongClaimKong" color="45,75,120,255">
            <children>
              <element type="UIImage" name="KongTile0" visible="false" anchor="Bottom" y="-3" width="21" height="28" />
            </children>
          </element>
          <element type="UIButton" name="Chow0" visible="false" width="104" height="56" text="{#button.ClaimChow0}" fontSize="18" verticalAlign="Top" action="MahjongClaimChow" value="0" color="45,75,120,255">
            <children>
              <element type="UIImage" name="Chow0Tile0" visible="false" anchor="Bottom" x="-23" y="-3" width="21" height="28" />
              <element type="UIImage" name="Chow0Tile1" visible="false" anchor="Bottom" y="-3" width="21" height="28" />
              <element type="UIImage" name="Chow0Tile2" visible="false" anchor="Bottom" x="23" y="-3" width="21" height="28" />
            </children>
          </element>
          <element type="UIButton" name="Chow1" visible="false" width="104" height="56" text="{#button.ClaimChow1}" fontSize="18" verticalAlign="Top" action="MahjongClaimChow" value="1" color="45,75,120,255">
            <children>
              <element type="UIImage" name="Chow1Tile0" visible="false" anchor="Bottom" x="-23" y="-3" width="21" height="28" />
              <element type="UIImage" name="Chow1Tile1" visible="false" anchor="Bottom" y="-3" width="21" height="28" />
              <element type="UIImage" name="Chow1Tile2" visible="false" anchor="Bottom" x="23" y="-3" width="21" height="28" />
            </children>
          </element>
          <element type="UIButton" name="Chow2" visible="false" width="104" height="56" text="{#button.ClaimChow2}" fontSize="18" verticalAlign="Top" action="MahjongClaimChow" value="2" color="45,75,120,255">
            <children>
              <element type="UIImage" name="Chow2Tile0" visible="false" anchor="Bottom" x="-23" y="-3" width="21" height="28" />
              <element type="UIImage" name="Chow2Tile1" visible="false" anchor="Bottom" y="-3" width="21" height="28" />
              <element type="UIImage" name="Chow2Tile2" visible="false" anchor="Bottom" x="23" y="-3" width="21" height="28" />
            </children>
          </element>
          <element type="UIButton" name="ConcealedKong0" visible="false" width="104" height="56" text="{#button.ConcealedKong0}" fontSize="18" verticalAlign="Top" action="MahjongConcealedKong" value="0" color="70,70,100,255">
            <children>
              <element type="UIImage" name="ConcealedKong0Tile0" visible="false" anchor="Bottom" y="-3" width="21" height="28" />
            </children>
          </element>
          <element type="UIButton" name="ConcealedKong1" visible="false" width="104" height="56" text="{#button.ConcealedKong1}" fontSize="18" verticalAlign="Top" action="MahjongConcealedKong" value="1" color="70,70,100,255">
            <children>
              <element type="UIImage" name="ConcealedKong1Tile0" visible="false" anchor="Bottom" y="-3" width="21" height="28" />
            </children>
          </element>
          <element type="UIButton" name="ConcealedKong2" visible="false" width="104" height="56" text="{#button.ConcealedKong2}" fontSize="18" verticalAlign="Top" action="MahjongConcealedKong" value="2" color="70,70,100,255">
            <children>
              <element type="UIImage" name="ConcealedKong2Tile0" visible="false" anchor="Bottom" y="-3" width="21" height="28" />
            </children>
          </element>
          <element type="UIButton" name="UpgradeKong" visible="false" width="104" height="56" text="{#button.UpgradeKong}" fontSize="18" verticalAlign="Top" action="MahjongUpgradeKong" color="70,70,100,255">
            <children>
              <element type="UIImage" name="UpgradeKongTile0" visible="false" anchor="Bottom" y="-3" width="21" height="28" />
            </children>
          </element>
          <element type="UIButton" name="Pass" visible="false" width="104" height="56" text="{#button.Pass}" fontSize="22" action="MahjongPass" color="90,50,50,255" />
          <element type="UIToggle" name="Declare" visible="false" bind="declareNext" onValue="on" offValue="off" width="104" height="56" text="{#button.Declare}" fontSize="22" action="MahjongDeclare" color="70,70,100,255" />
          </children>
        </element>
      </elements>
      <variants>
        <variant when="orientation:portrait">
          <overrides>
            <set element="Hint" x="480" y="716" width="232" height="112" />
            <set element="ActionRow" x="12" y="924" width="696" height="68" />
            <set element="Win" width="92" height="68" />
            <set element="Mahjong" width="92" height="68" />
            <set element="Pung" width="92" height="68" />
            <set element="Kong" width="92" height="68" />
            <set element="Chow0" width="92" height="68" />
            <set element="Chow1" width="92" height="68" />
            <set element="Chow2" width="92" height="68" />
            <set element="ConcealedKong0" width="92" height="68" />
            <set element="ConcealedKong1" width="92" height="68" />
            <set element="ConcealedKong2" width="92" height="68" />
            <set element="UpgradeKong" width="92" height="68" />
            <set element="Pass" width="92" height="68" />
            <set element="Declare" width="124" height="68" />
          </overrides>
        </variant>
        <variant when="orientation:landscape;maxAspect:1.55">
          <overrides>
            <set element="Hint" x="280" y="444" width="180" height="124" />
            <set element="ActionRow" x="620" y="500" width="376" />
            <set element="Win" width="88" fontSize="18" />
            <set element="Mahjong" width="88" />
            <set element="Pung" width="88" />
            <set element="Kong" width="88" />
            <set element="Chow0" width="88" />
            <set element="Chow1" width="88" />
            <set element="Chow2" width="88" />
            <set element="ConcealedKong0" width="88" />
            <set element="ConcealedKong1" width="88" />
            <set element="ConcealedKong2" width="88" />
            <set element="UpgradeKong" width="104" />
            <set element="Pass" width="88" />
            <set element="Declare" width="88" />
          </overrides>
        </variant>
        <variant when="minAspect:2">
          <overrides>
            <set element="Hint" x="972" />
            <set element="ActionRow" x="860" />
          </overrides>
        </variant>
      </variants>
    </component>
  </components>
</node>
